      "text": "Oh, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.71,
      "end": 104.71,
      "text": "What's a lock-in?"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.71,
      "end": 106.71,
      "text": "Oh, every year at Ridgeway, they have this thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.71,
      "end": 108.71,
