    },
    {
      "start": 223.15,
      "end": 225.15,
      "text": "Your web show isn't as good as this web show."
    },
    {
      "start": 225.15,
      "end": 228.15,
      "text": "But your web show can smell like this web show."
    },
    {
      "start": 228.15,
      "end": 232.15,
      "text": "If you have a Gibby holding a large blob of tuna fish salad."
    },
    {
      "start": 232.15,
