      "text": "Oh, I'm on a cow."
    },
    {
      "start": 234.15,
      "end": 235.15,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 235.15,
      "end": 239.98,
      "text": "Now, before we go, have a hand for our newest edition of iCarol."
    },
    {
      "start": 239.98,
      "end": 241.98,
