    },
    {
      "start": 317.99,
      "end": 319.99,
      "text": "Can I work with you guys on your project?"
    },
    {
      "start": 319.99,
      "end": 323.66,
      "text": "You're asking if you can help us?"
    },
    {
      "start": 323.66,
      "end": 325.66,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 325.66,
      "end": 327.66,
      "text": "With a school project?"
    },
    {
      "start": 327.66,
      "end": 329.66,
      "text": "I think it sounds really interesting."
    },
    {
      "start": 329.66,
      "end": 337.38,
      "text": "Feels like Sam."
    },
    {
      "start": 337.38,
      "end": 341.07,
      "text": "Smells like Sam."
    },
    {
      "start": 341.07,
      "end": 344.7,
      "text": "Can I help with the project or what?"
    },
    {
      "start": 344.7,
      "end": 345.7,
      "text": "Sure, you can help."
    },
    {
      "start": 345.7,
      "end": 346.7,
      "text": "I'll bring the fudge."
    },
    {
      "start": 346.7,
      "end": 348.7,
      "text": "I'll bring my mouth."
    },
    {
      "start": 348.7,
      "end": 359.05,
      "text": "Yeah, kiddo."
    },
    {
      "start": 359.05,
      "end": 360.05,
      "text": "You want to grab some dinner tonight?"
    },
    {
      "start": 360.05,
      "end": 362.05,
      "text": "I thought you were hanging out with Sam."
    },
    {
      "start": 363.05,
      "end": 366.05,
      "text": "I was supposed to, but she's going to see him move me with Freddie and Brad."
    },
    {
      "start": 366.05,
      "end": 368.05,
      "text": "Sam wants to hang out with them?"
    },
    {
      "start": 368.05,
      "end": 369.05,
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "start": 369.05,
      "end": 370.05,
      "text": "Weird, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 370.05,
      "end": 371.05,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 371.05,
      "end": 372.05,
      "text": "What's that for?"
    },
    {
      "start": 372.05,
      "end": 373.05,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "start": 373.05,
      "end": 379.05,
      "text": "The fire department sent us a letter saying we've reached our maximum number of calls for the year."
    },
    {
      "start": 379.05,
      "end": 381.05,
      "text": "So I bought this."
    },
    {
      "start": 381.05,
      "end": 382.05,
      "text": "Nice."
    },
    {
      "start": 382.05,
      "end": 383.05,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 383.05,
      "end": 386.05,
      "text": "And I just fixed an nozzle to make it extra powerful."
    },
    {
      "start": 386.05,
      "end": 388.05,
      "text": "Gonna mount it on the wall over there."
    },
    {
      "start": 388.05,
      "end": 390.05,
      "text": "Seems like a good place to mount it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 390.05,
      "end": 392.42,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "start": 392.42,
      "end": 395.42,
      "text": "Hey, so you know about this lock-in thing on Saturday night at Ridgeway."
    },
    {
      "start": 395.42,
      "end": 397.42,
      "text": "We're all going to try to finish our school projects."
    },
    {
      "start": 397.42,
      "end": 398.42,
      "text": "No, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": 398.42,
      "end": 400.42,
      "text": "Well, give me an idea."
    },
    {
      "start": 400.42,
      "end": 402.42,
      "text": "Do you want to kind of cycle logical experiment?"
    },
    {
      "start": 402.42,
      "end": 403.42,
      "text": "Will you be our test subject?"
    },
    {
      "start": 403.42,
      "end": 405.42,
      "text": "I don't know."
    },
    {
      "start": 405.42,
      "end": 407.42,
      "text": "Saturday nights I usually watch cops with soccer's grandmother,"
    },
    {
      "start": 407.42,
      "end": 408.42,
      "text": "and I really need it."
    },
    {
      "start": 408.42,
      "end": 409.42,
      "text": "Come on."
    },
    {
      "start": 409.42,
      "end": 410.42,
      "text": "I'm okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 410.42,
      "end": 411.42,
      "text": "Cool."
    },
    {
      "start": 411.42,
      "end": 412.42,
      "text": "Now."
    },
    {
      "start": 413.42,
      "end": 415.42,
      "text": "I need to show you how this works."
    },
    {
      "start": 415.42,
      "end": 417.42,
      "text": "In case there's ever a fire, and I'm not home."
    },
    {
      "start": 417.42,
      "end": 418.42,
      "text": "All right, film it."
    },
    {
      "start": 418.42,
      "end": 421.93,
      "text": "See that paper cup right there?"
    },
    {
      "start": 421.93,
      "end": 422.93,
      "text": "I see the cup."
    },
    {
      "start": 422.93,
      "end": 424.93,
      "text": "I imagine I'm not home, and that cup is on fire."
    },
    {
      "start": 424.93,
      "end": 426.93,
      "text": "You don't, just go."
    },
    {
      "start": 426.93,
      "end": 435.93,
      "text": "Nope."
    },
    {
      "start": 435.93,
      "end": 437.93,
      "text": "You just pull this thing in."
    },
    {
      "start": 438.93,
      "end": 440.93,
      "text": "Point the nozzle, suchly."
    },
    {
      "start": 440.93,
      "end": 443.93,
      "text": "And calmly squeeze this out of me."
    },
    {
      "start": 443.93,
      "end": 459.25,
      "text": "And then you just put the extinguisher back in its wall bracket."
    },
    {
      "start": 459.25,
      "end": 466.74,
      "text": "And just do this."
    },
    {
      "start": 466.74,
      "end": 468.74,
      "text": "This is principal Franklin."
    },
    {
      "start": 468.74,
      "end": 469.74,
      "text": "It's now 9 p.m."
    },
    {
      "start": 469.74,
      "end": 472.74,
      "text": "and all exterior school doors have been locked."
    },
    {
      "start": 472.74,
      "end": 482.42,
