      "text": "Listen."
    },
    {
      "start": 796.24,
      "end": 797.24,
      "text": "What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 797.24,
      "end": 799.24,
      "text": "You know how we've been wondering what's up with Sam?"
    },
    {
      "start": 799.24,
      "end": 800.24,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 800.24,
      "end": 802.24,
      "text": "Why she's been wanting to hang with me and Brad all the time?"
