    {
      "start": 853.82,
      "end": 854.82,
      "text": "Uh-huh."
    },
    {
      "start": 854.82,
      "end": 857.82,
      "text": "So, how's your project going?"
    },
    {
      "start": 857.82,
      "end": 858.82,
      "text": "Good, I think."
    },
    {
      "start": 858.82,
      "end": 861.82,
      "text": "But I'm not sure because Benson freaked in right out the door a few minutes ago."
    },
    {
      "start": 861.82,
      "end": 866.6,
      "text": "How's Brad?"
    },
    {
      "start": 866.6,
      "end": 868.6,
      "text": "That's cool."
