      "text": "Damn."
    },
    {
      "start": 898.1,
      "end": 899.1,
      "text": "I know you will Brad."
    },
    {
      "start": 899.1,
      "end": 900.1,
      "text": "It's exciting."
    },
    {
      "start": 900.1,
