      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 901.1,
      "end": 903.1,
      "text": "Did you look fond of a tree or what?"
    },
    {
      "start": 903.1,
      "end": 906.1,
      "text": "You want to know how I know you're in love with Brad?"
    },
