      "start": 939.36,
      "end": 940.36,
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "start": 940.36,
      "end": 941.36,
      "text": "Because Brad's awesome."
    },
    {
      "start": 941.36,
      "end": 943.36,
      "text": "It's the first time since ever like the guy"
