    },
    {
      "start": 949.36,
      "end": 951.36,
      "text": "But if Sam won't even admit that she likes him,"
    },
    {
      "start": 951.36,
      "end": 952.36,
      "text": "how are we going to get him?"
    },
    {
      "start": 952.36,
      "end": 953.36,
      "text": "He's in the animal channel."
    },
    {
      "start": 953.36,
      "end": 961.22,
      "text": "But the horses."
    },
    {
      "start": 961.22,
