    {
      "start": 971.21,
      "end": 976.86,
      "text": "And then they like turn the barn lights down."
    },
    {
      "start": 976.86,
      "end": 978.86,
      "text": "And you know what I'm talking about?"
    },
    {
      "start": 978.86,
      "end": 980.86,
      "text": "Why are you making me see it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 981.86,
      "end": 983.86,
      "text": "So we get Sam and Brad."
    },
    {
      "start": 983.86,
