      "start": 995.86,
      "end": 996.86,
      "text": "Please."
    },
    {
      "start": 996.86,
      "end": 997.86,
      "text": "Please just clean it up."
    },
    {
      "start": 997.86,
      "end": 998.86,
      "text": "We have something really important to do."
    },
    {
      "start": 998.86,
      "end": 999.86,
      "text": "Come on."
    },
    {
      "start": 999.86,
      "end": 1001.86,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "start": 1001.86,
      "end": 1002.86,
      "text": "Always make."
    },
    {
      "start": 1002.86,
      "end": 1003.86,
      "text": "Give me clean the vomit."
    },
    {
      "start": 1003.86,
      "end": 1004.86,
      "text": "I'll let the sensory steam in this chamber."
    },
    {
      "start": 1004.86,
      "end": 1014.32,
      "text": "Do you learn to make fudge?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1014.32,
      "end": 1016.32,
      "text": "Oh, my great grandma taught me."
    },
    {
      "start": 1016.32,
      "end": 1017.32,
      "text": "She was a good woman, Brad."
    },
    {
      "start": 1017.32,
      "end": 1020.32,
      "text": "She's still alive."
    },
    {
      "start": 1020.32,
      "end": 1021.32,
      "text": "Even better."
    },
    {
      "start": 1021.32,
      "end": 1032.96,
      "text": "I just saw a two-headed frog out in the courtyard."
    },
    {
      "start": 1032.96,
      "end": 1036.17,
      "text": "Two heads."
    },
    {
      "start": 1036.17,
      "end": 1038.17,
      "text": "On a frog."
    },
    {
      "start": 1038.17,
      "end": 1040.17,
      "text": "Come on. I'll show you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1040.17,
      "end": 1042.17,
      "text": "Yes. Follow, Freddie."
    },
    {
      "start": 1042.17,
      "end": 1050.7,
      "text": "Don't go. Why not?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1050.7,
      "end": 1052.7,
      "text": "We want to see the two-headed frog."
    },
    {
      "start": 1052.7,
      "end": 1053.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "start": 1053.7,
      "end": 1056.7,
      "text": "Freddie exaggerated the number of heads."
    },
    {
      "start": 1056.7,
      "end": 1057.7,
      "text": "I'm not coming back."
    },
    {
      "start": 1057.7,
      "end": 1075.26,
      "text": "Just a one-headed frog."
    },
    {
      "start": 1075.26,
      "end": 1077.26,
      "text": "Listen."
    },
    {
      "start": 1077.26,
      "end": 1079.26,
      "text": "Listen, impressive."
    },
    {
      "start": 1079.26,
      "end": 1089.04,
      "text": "It wears the blindfold if it wants to be fed."
    },
    {
      "start": 1089.04,
      "end": 1094.28,
      "text": "I'm doing that accent. It's gripping me out."
    },
    {
      "start": 1094.28,
      "end": 1099.38,
      "text": "I'll feed you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1099.38,
      "end": 1109.48,
      "text": "Here's a bullet chowder and a spoon."
    },
    {
      "start": 1109.48,
      "end": 1111.48,
      "text": "Are you sure we should do this?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1111.48,
      "end": 1112.48,
      "text": "It's for science."
    },
    {
      "start": 1112.48,
      "end": 1115.48,
      "text": "So what science ever done for me?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1115.48,
      "end": 1118.48,
      "text": "Artificial sweeteners, a man on the moon."
    },
    {
      "start": 1118.48,
      "end": 1120.48,
      "text": "Liquid soap."
    },
    {
      "start": 1120.48,
      "end": 1121.48,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 1121.48,
      "end": 1125.34,
      "text": "Put the chowder through the saw."
    },
    {
      "start": 1125.34,
      "end": 1128.06,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "start": 1128.06,
      "end": 1129.06,
      "text": "Okay, Spencer."
    },
    {
      "start": 1129.06,
      "end": 1132.06,
      "text": "Now, just reach to your left and give your hand your bowl of chowder and a spoon."
    },
    {
      "start": 1132.06,
      "end": 1134.06,
      "text": "About time."
    },
    {
      "start": 1134.06,
      "end": 1138.62,
      "text": "Now, push the button."
    },
    {
      "start": 1138.62,
      "end": 1173.8,
      "text": "Electricution."
    },
    {
      "start": 1173.8,
      "end": 1174.8,
      "text": "Curbs."
    },
    {
      "start": 1174.8,
      "end": 1175.8,
      "text": "Appetite."
    },
    {
      "start": 1175.8,
      "end": 1180.9,
      "text": "Carly-shay."
    },
    {
      "start": 1180.9,
      "end": 1183.86,
      "text": "Back in a sec."
    },
    {
      "start": 1183.86,
      "end": 1184.86,
      "text": "Might be more than a sec."
    },
    {
      "start": 1184.86,
      "end": 1189.22,
      "text": "Point here."
    },
    {
      "start": 1189.22,
      "end": 1190.22,
      "text": "Where did you with Brad?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1190.22,
      "end": 1192.22,
      "text": "That wasn't cool."
    },
    {
      "start": 1192.22,
      "end": 1193.22,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1193.22,
      "end": 1197.22,
      "text": "I know the whole two-headed frog thing was just to get me along with Brad."
    },
    {
      "start": 1197.22,
      "end": 1198.22,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 1198.22,
      "end": 1199.22,
      "text": "I was hooking you up."
    },
    {
      "start": 1199.22,
      "end": 1201.22,
      "text": "I don't need you to hook me up."
    },
    {
      "start": 1201.22,
      "end": 1202.22,
      "text": "You love him."
    },
    {
      "start": 1202.22,
      "end": 1203.22,
      "text": "I don't love him."
    },
    {
      "start": 1203.22,
      "end": 1206.59,
      "text": "Pat said you do."
    },
    {
      "start": 1206.59,
      "end": 1209.16,
      "text": "It's a stupid come different."
    },
    {
      "start": 1209.16,
      "end": 1212.59,
      "text": "I haven't."
    },
    {
      "start": 1212.59,
      "end": 1217.53,
      "text": "I'm pretty in Brad."
    },
    {
      "start": 1217.53,
      "end": 1218.53,
      "text": "Do anything."
    },
    {
      "start": 1218.53,
      "end": 1220.53,
      "text": "All of a sudden you want to tag along."
    },
    {
      "start": 1220.53,
      "end": 1223.53,
      "text": "Brad's so nice."
    },
    {
      "start": 1223.53,
      "end": 1224.53,
      "text": "He's polite."
    },
    {
      "start": 1224.53,
      "end": 1225.53,
      "text": "He's smart."
    },
    {
      "start": 1225.53,
      "end": 1226.53,
      "text": "He's got no warrants."
    },
    {
      "start": 1226.53,
      "end": 1230.54,
      "text": "But you could times you guys could have together."
    },
    {
      "start": 1230.54,
      "end": 1234.18,
      "text": "Don't you want a nice boyfriend?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1234.18,
      "end": 1236.52,
      "text": "Oh, for it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1236.52,
      "end": 1237.52,
      "text": "Make a move."
    },
    {
      "start": 1237.52,
      "end": 1240.83,
      "text": "I just want you to be happy."
    },
    {
      "start": 1240.83,
      "end": 1246.39,
      "text": "Then bake me a pie."
    },
    {
      "start": 1246.39,
      "end": 1251.94,
      "text": "I love pie."
    },
    {
      "start": 1251.94,
      "end": 1252.94,
      "text": "Give it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1252.94,
      "end": 1266.48,
      "text": "You."
    },
    {
      "start": 1267.48,
      "end": 1269.48,
      "text": "Carly's in here to find me."
    },
    {
      "start": 1269.48,
      "end": 1270.48,
      "text": "Nope."
    },
    {
      "start": 1270.48,
      "end": 1273.48,
      "text": "Oh, so you don't know we had a little argument."
    },
    {
      "start": 1273.48,
      "end": 1275.48,
      "text": "She told me about your little argument."
    },
    {
      "start": 1275.48,
      "end": 1278.48,
      "text": "I just said she didn't tell me to come find you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1278.48,
      "end": 1279.48,
      "text": "Good."
    },
    {
      "start": 1279.48,
      "end": 1281.48,
      "text": "But Carly's right."
    },
    {
      "start": 1281.48,
      "end": 1282.48,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "start": 1282.48,
      "end": 1285.48,
      "text": "Brone all you want."
    },
    {
      "start": 1285.48,
      "end": 1289.48,
      "text": "I don't care if your stupid pairpad app says about me being in love."
    },
    {
      "start": 1289.48,
      "end": 1291.48,
      "text": "I'm not into Brad like that."
    },
    {
      "start": 1292.48,
      "end": 1295.48,
      "text": "Lately, every time I tell you the Brad and I are doing something together,"
    },
    {
      "start": 1295.48,
      "end": 1297.48,
      "text": "you want to come hang with us."
    },
    {
      "start": 1297.48,
      "end": 1298.48,
      "text": "And that means I'm in love with him?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1298.48,
      "end": 1301.89,
      "text": "Well, you hate me."
    },
    {
      "start": 1301.89,
      "end": 1302.89,
      "text": "And I'm saying I hate you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1302.89,
      "end": 1306.2,
      "text": "Yeah, you have."
    },
    {
      "start": 1306.2,
      "end": 1308.2,
      "text": "Like 900 times."
    },
    {
      "start": 1308.2,
      "end": 1310.2,
      "text": "I still have the birthday card you gave me."
    },
    {
      "start": 1310.2,
      "end": 1311.2,
      "text": "It says happy birthday."
    },
    {
      "start": 1311.2,
      "end": 1313.2,
      "text": "I hate you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1313.2,
      "end": 1315.2,
      "text": "Hate Sam."
    },
    {
      "start": 1315.2,
      "end": 1318.77,
      "text": "Just leave."
    },
    {
      "start": 1318.77,
      "end": 1319.77,
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "start": 1319.77,
      "end": 1321.77,
      "text": "Ali."
    },
    {
      "start": 1321.77,
      "end": 1322.77,
      "text": "Bye."
    },
    {
      "start": 1322.77,
      "end": 1323.77,
      "text": "Before I go."
    },
    {
      "start": 1323.77,
      "end": 1324.77,
      "text": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1324.77,
      "end": 1328.77,
      "text": "Get out of here before I do a double fist dance on your face."
    },
    {
      "start": 1328.77,
      "end": 1332.77,
      "text": "You can threaten your double fist face dancing all you want."
    },
    {
      "start": 1332.77,
      "end": 1334.77,
      "text": "But Carly's still right."
    },
    {
      "start": 1334.77,
      "end": 1338.77,
      "text": "Look, I know it's scary for you to put your feelings out there."
    },
    {
      "start": 1338.77,
      "end": 1341.77,
      "text": "Because you never know if the person you like is going to like you back."
    },
    {
      "start": 1341.77,
      "end": 1343.77,
      "text": "Everyone feels that way."
    },
    {
      "start": 1343.77,
      "end": 1346.77,
      "text": "But you never know what might happen if you don't..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1346.77,
      "end": 1374.91,
      "text": "Sorry."
    },
    {
      "start": 1374.91,
      "end": 1408.04,
      "text": "It's cool."
    }
  ]
}